      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GUNNA RELOAD (6) will find this easier than her resuming effort in last week's Frith Stakes when she was forced to race three wide. Unbeaten in four second-up attempts so will be a lot better for that outing and strikes at 50 per cent at this circuit and distance. Well-performed mare who should be too good. PEACE OUT (9) comes through the Vicbred Super Series where she came from the back row for fifth in both her heat and in the final. Cops a wide draw but she is capable enough with some luck on her side. A TRUE LOVE (5) has placed in her last two attempts in the country and did produce a couple of close-up efforts here back in August. THE SWIFT ONE (8) and SHE THE DEVIL (7) are both on a quick back-up and are first four hopes with some luck from their wide draws.",
